    {
      "id": "t_128",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 532,
      "width": 89.12841796875,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 84610775,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795082257721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the next thread\ncomputes the\nnext square",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 51,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the next thread\ncomputes the\nnext square",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t_129",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 171.591796875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1880305177,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795082257721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At each k, the thread:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 19,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At each k, the thread:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t_130",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 271.93359375,
      "height": 67.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 814816247,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795082257721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Reads the dark red numbers of s_A\n    and the dark blue numbers of s_B\n    into registers.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 62,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Reads the dark red numbers of s_A\n    and the dark blue numbers of s_B\n    into registers.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t_131",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 435,
      "width": 260.208984375,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 832045817,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795082257721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Multiplies every dark red number\n    with every dark blue number, and\n    adds each product to the element\n    of its square in the same row\n    and column.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 107,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Multiplies every dark red number\n    with every dark blue number, and\n    adds each product to the element\n    of its square in the same row\n    and column.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t_132",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 288.9228515625,
      "height": 67.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1444447511,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795082257721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each number of s_A is used for a whole\nrow of the square, and each number of\ns_B for a whole column.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 62,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each number of s_A is used for a whole\nrow of the square, and each number of\ns_B for a whole column.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
